    "macOS also uses the fn key. Set “Press 🌐 key to” to Do Nothing so it starts Airdraft instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 也会使用 fn 键。请将“按下 🌐 键以”设为“不执行任何操作”，让它改为启动 Airdraft。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 也會使用 fn 鍵。請將「按下 🌐 鍵來」設為「不執行任何動作」，讓它改為啟動 Airdraft。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS asks once. Airdraft only records while you use your shortcut." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 只会询问一次。Airdraft 只会在你使用快捷键时录音。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 只會詢問一次。Airdraft 只會在你使用快速鍵時錄音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS has not granted this running copy access. An enabled switch for another copy or an older build does not confirm access for this one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 尚未授予这份正在运行的 Airdraft 访问权限。其他副本或旧版本的开关已打开，并不代表这一份已获得访问权限。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 尚未授予這份正在執行的 Airdraft 存取權。其他副本或舊版本的開關已開啟，並不代表這一份已取得存取權。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS manages language assets." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "语言资源由 macOS 管理。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "語言資源由 macOS 管理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS may retain old Accessibility entries. Remove obsolete Airdraft entries with the minus button in System Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 可能保留旧的“辅助功能”条目。请在“系统设置”中用减号按钮移除过时的 Airdraft 条目。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 可能保留舊的「輔助使用」項目。請在「系統設定」中用減號按鈕移除過時的 Airdraft 項目。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
